1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,620
This sugar cube weighs more than every human on Earth

2
00:00:03,890 --> 00:00:04,400
Combined.

3
00:00:05,219 --> 00:00:06,580
Because it isn't sugar.

4
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:08,740
It's a piece of a neutron star.

5
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:12,039
When a giant star dies, its core collapses,

6
00:00:12,519 --> 00:00:18,079
Squeezing more mass than our Sun into a ball just 20 km (12 miles) wide.

7
00:00:18,955 --> 00:00:20,140
About the size of a city.

8
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:22,219
But here's the crazy part.

9
00:00:23,015 --> 00:00:25,399
Some of them spin over 700 times

10
00:00:25,644 --> 00:00:26,399
Every second.

11
00:00:27,125 --> 00:00:31,280
So one sugar cube of it, here on Earth, would weigh a billion tons.

12
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:32,780
And that's why...
